Usage: homi <command> [<args>]

Hold NVMe devices open for multi-process sharing. Secondary processes attach to the same controllers by passing the same --homi-id.

Where <command> is one of:

  serve            | Open the given devices and hold them open

See 'homi <command> --help' for the description of [<args>]

homi - Host-Orchestrated Multi-path I/O -- ver: {major: 0, minor: 7, patch: 5}
